u.","meaning":"Japanese is very interesting."},{"japanese":"今日はとても忙しいです。","romaji":"Kyou wa totemo isogashii desu.","meaning":"I am very busy today."},{"japanese":"この公園はとても広いです。","romaji":"Kono kouen wa totemo hiroi desu.","meaning":"This park is very large."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":65,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"この映画はあまりおもしろくないです。","romaji":"Kono eiga wa amari omoshirokunai desu.","meaning":"This movie is not very interesting."},{"japanese":"今日はあまり寒くないです。","romaji":"Kyou wa amari samukunai desu.","meaning":"It is not very cold today."},{"japanese":"この店の料理はあまり高くないです。","romaji":"Kono mise no ryouri wa amari takakunai desu.","meaning":"The food at this shop is not very expensive."},{"japanese":"私はあまりテレビを見ません。","romaji":"Watashi wa amari terebi o mimasen.","meaning":"I do not watch much television."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":66,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"漢字がぜんぜん分かりません。","romaji":"Kanji ga zenzen wakarimasen.","meaning":"I do not understand kanji at all."},{"japanese":"今日はぜんぜん寒くないです。","romaji":"Kyou wa zenzen samukunai desu.","meaning":"It is not cold at all today."},{"japanese":"弟は野菜をぜんぜん食べません。","romaji":"Otouto wa yasai o zenzen tabemasen.","meaning":"My younger brother does not eat vegetables at all."},{"japanese":"この道はぜんぜん分かりません。","romaji":"Kono michi wa zenzen wakarimasen.","meaning":"I do not know this road at all."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":67,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"私は犬が好きです。","romaji":"Watashi wa inu ga suki desu.","meaning":"I like dogs."},{"japanese":"妹は音楽が好きです。","romaji":"Imouto wa ongaku ga suki desu.","meaning":"My younger sister likes music."},{"japanese":"田中さんは日本料理が好きです。","romaji":"Tanaka-san wa nihon ryouri ga suki desu.","meaning":"Tanaka likes Japanese food."},{"japanese":"母は花が好きです。","romaji":"Haha wa hana ga suki desu.","meaning":"My mother likes flowers."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":68,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"私は納豆が嫌いです。","romaji":"Watashi wa nattou ga kirai desu.","meaning":"I dislike natto."},{"japanese":"弟は魚が嫌いです。","romaji":"Otouto wa sakana ga kirai desu.","meaning":"My younger brother dislikes fish."},{"japanese":"彼女は雨の日が嫌いです。","romaji":"Kanojo wa ame no hi ga kirai desu.","meaning":"She dislikes rainy days."},{"japanese":"私は苦いコーヒーが嫌いです。","romaji":"Watashi wa nigai koohii ga kirai desu.","meaning":"I dislike bitter coffee."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":69,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"姉は料理が上手です。","romaji":"Ane wa ryouri ga jouzu desu.","meaning":"My older sister is good at cooking."},{"japanese":"田中さんはテニスが上手です。","romaji":"Tanaka-san wa tenisu ga jouzu desu.","meaning":"Tanaka is good at tennis."},{"japanese":"母は歌が上手です。","romaji":"Haha wa uta ga jouzu desu.","meaning":"My mother is good at singing."},{"japanese":"彼は日本語が上手です。","romaji":"Kare wa nihongo ga jouzu desu.","meaning":"He is good at Japanese."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":70,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"私は絵が下手です。","romaji":"Watashi wa e ga heta desu.","meaning":"I am bad at drawing."},{"japanese":"弟は料理が下手です。","romaji":"Otouto wa ryouri ga heta desu.","meaning":"My younger brother is bad at cooking."},{"japanese":"彼女は水泳が下手です。","romaji":"Kanojo wa suiei ga heta desu.","meaning":"She is bad at swimming."},{"japanese":"私はダンスが下手です。","romaji":"Watashi wa dansu ga heta desu.","meaning":"I am bad at dancing."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":71,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"新しいパソコンがほしいです。","romaji":"Atarashii pasokon ga hoshii desu.","meaning":"I want a new computer."},{"japanese":"夏休みに時間がほしいです。","romaji":"Natsuyasumi ni jikan ga hoshii desu.","meaning":"I want some time during summer vacation."},{"japanese":"妹は犬がほしいです。","romaji":"Imouto wa inu ga hoshii desu.","meaning":"My younger sister wants a dog."},{"japanese":"私は日本の辞書がほしいです。","romaji":"Watashi wa Nihon no jisho ga hoshii desu.","meaning":"I want a Japanese dictionary."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":72,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"机の下に箱があります。","romaji":"Tsukue no shita ni hako ga arimasu.","meaning":"There is a box under the desk."},{"japanese":"かばんの中に財布があります。","romaji":"Kaban no naka ni saifu ga arimasu.","meaning":"There is a wallet in the bag."},{"japanese":"駅の近くに公園があります。","romaji":"Eki no chikaku ni kouen ga arimasu.","meaning":"There is a park near the station."},{"japanese":"冷蔵庫に卵があります。","romaji":"Reizouko ni tamago ga arimasu.","meaning":"There are eggs in the refrigerator."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":73,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"教室に学生がいます。","romaji":"Kyoushitsu ni gakusei ga imasu.","meaning":"There are students in the classroom."},{"japanese":"庭に白い猫がいます。","romaji":"Niwa ni shiroi neko ga imasu.","meaning":"There is a white cat in the garden."},{"japanese":"駅の前に友達がいます。","romaji":"Eki no mae ni tomodachi ga imasu.","meaning":"My friend is in front of the station."},{"japanese":"公園に子どもがいます。","romaji":"Kouen ni kodomo ga imasu.","meaning":"There are children in the park."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":74,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"この近くに郵便局がありますか。","romaji":"Kono chikaku ni yuubinkyoku ga arimasu ka.","meaning":"Is there a post office near here?"},{"japanese":"駅の中にトイレがありますか。","romaji":"Eki no naka ni toire ga arimasu ka.","meaning":"Is there a restroom inside the station?"},{"japanese":"冷蔵庫に牛乳がありますか。","romaji":"Reizouko ni gyuunyuu ga arimasu ka.","meaning":"Is there milk in the refrigerator?"},{"japanese":"この町に大きい病院がありますか。","romaji":"Kono machi ni ookii byouin ga arimasu ka.","meaning":"Is there a large hospital in this town?"}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":75,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"教室に先生がいますか。","romaji":"Kyoushitsu ni sensei ga imasu ka.","meaning":"Is the teacher in the classroom?"},{"japanese":"公園に犬がいますか。","romaji":"Kouen ni inu ga imasu ka.","meaning":"Are there dogs in the park?"},{"japanese":"家にお母さんがいますか。","romaji":"Ie ni okaasan ga imasu ka.","meaning":"Is your mother at home?"},{"japanese":"駅に田中さんがいますか。","romaji":"Eki ni Tanaka-san ga imasu ka.","meaning":"Is Tanaka at the station?"}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":76,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"猫はベッドの上にいます。","romaji":"Neko wa beddo no ue ni imasu.","meaning":"The cat is on the bed."},{"japanese":"かばんは机の下にあります。","romaji":"Kaban wa tsukue no shita ni arimasu.","meaning":"The bag is under the desk."},{"japanese":"銀行は郵便局の隣にあります。","romaji":"Ginkou wa yuubinkyoku no tonari ni arimasu.","meaning":"The bank is next to the post office."},{"japanese":"公園は学校の前にあります。","romaji":"Kouen wa gakkou no mae ni arimasu.","meaning":"The park is in front of the school."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":77,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"寝るまえに歯を磨きます。","romaji":"Neru mae ni ha o migakimasu.","meaning":"I brush my teeth before going to bed."},{"japanese":"学校へ行くまえに朝ご飯を食べます。","romaji":"Gakkou e iku mae ni asagohan o tabemasu.","meaning":"I eat breakfast before going to school."},{"japanese":"出かけるまえに窓を閉めます。","romaji":"Dekakeru mae ni mado o shimemasu.","meaning":"I close the window before going out."},{"japanese":"勉強するまえに部屋を掃除します。","romaji":"Benkyou suru mae ni heya o souji shimasu.","meaning":"I clean my room before studying."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":78,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"宿題をしたあとで、テレビを見ます。","romaji":"Shukudai o shita ato de, terebi o mimasu.","meaning":"I watch television after doing my homework."},{"japanese":"昼ご飯を食べたあとで散歩します。","romaji":"Hirugohan o tabeta ato de sanpo shimasu.","meaning":"I take a walk after lunch."},{"japanese":"映画を見たあとで友達と話しました。","romaji":"Eiga o mita ato de tomodachi to hanashimashita.","meaning":"I talked with a friend after watching the movie."},{"japanese":"買い物をしたあとで家に帰ります。","romaji":"Kaimono o shita ato de ie ni kaerimasu.","meaning":"I go home after shopping."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":79,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"子どもの時、よく公園で遊びました。","romaji":"Kodomo no toki, yoku kouen de asobimashita.","meaning":"When I was a child, I often played in the park."},{"japanese":"日本へ行く時、カメラを持って行きます。","romaji":"Nihon e iku toki, kamera o motte ikimasu.","meaning":"When I go to Japan, I take a camera."},{"japanese":"忙しい時、母が手伝います。","romaji":"Isogashii toki, haha ga tetsudaimasu.","meaning":"When I am busy, my mother helps me."},{"japanese":"家に帰った時、電話してください。","romaji":"Ie ni kaetta toki, denwa shite kudasai.","meaning":"Please call when you get home."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":80,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"毎朝七時ごろ起きます。","romaji":"Maiasa shichi-ji goro okimasu.","meaning":"I get up around seven every morning."},{"japanese":"午後三時ごろ雨が降りました。","romaji":"Gogo san-ji goro ame ga furimashita.","meaning":"It rained around three in the afternoon."},{"japanese":"八時ごろ駅に着きます。","romaji":"Hachi-ji goro eki ni tsukimasu.","meaning":"I arrive at the station around eight."},{"japanese":"夜十時ごろ寝ます。","romaji":"Yoru juu-ji goro nemasu.","meaning":"I go to bed around ten at night."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":81,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"毎日、日本語を練習します。","romaji":"Mainichi, nihongo o renshuu shimasu.","meaning":"I practice Japanese every day."},{"japanese":"毎週、図書館へ行きます。","romaji":"Maishuu, toshokan e ikimasu.","meaning":"I go to the library every week."},{"japanese":"毎朝、牛乳を飲みます。","romaji":"Maiasa, gyuunyuu o nomimasu.","meaning":"I drink milk every morning."},{"japanese":"毎晩、日記を書きます。","romaji":"Maiban, nikki o kakimasu.","meaning":"I write in my diary every night."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":82,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"二時間、日本語を勉強しました。","romaji":"Ni-jikan, nihongo o benkyou shimashita.","meaning":"I studied Japanese for two hours."},{"japanese":"毎日三十分歩きます。","romaji":"Mainichi sanjuppun arukimasu.","meaning":"I walk for thirty minutes every day."},{"japanese":"一週間、東京にいました。","romaji":"Isshuukan, Tokyo ni imashita.","meaning":"I was in Tokyo for one week."},{"japanese":"四時間、電車に乗りました。","romaji":"Yo-jikan, densha ni norimashita.","meaning":"I rode the train for four hours."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":83,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"月曜日に試験があります。","romaji":"Getsuyoubi ni shiken ga arimasu.","meaning":"There is an exam on Monday."},{"japanese":"七月七日に友達に会います。","romaji":"Shichi-gatsu nanoka ni tomodachi ni aimasu.","meaning":"I will meet my friend on July seventh."},{"japanese":"日曜日に家族と出かけます。","romaji":"Nichiyoubi ni kazoku to dekakemasu.","meaning":"I go out with my family on Sunday."},{"japanese":"三月二日に日本へ行きます。","romaji":"San-gatsu futsuka ni Nihon e ikimasu.","meaning":"I am going to Japan on March second."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":84,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"みかんを三つ買いました。","romaji":"Mikan o mittsu kaimashita.","meaning":"I bought three mandarins."},{"japanese":"卵を四つ使います。","romaji":"Tamago o yottsu tsukaimasu.","meaning":"I use four eggs."},{"japanese":"りんごを二つください。","romaji":"Ringo o futatsu kudasai.","meaning":"Please give me two apples."},{"japanese":"箱が五つあります。","romaji":"Hako ga itsutsu arimasu.","meaning":"There are five boxes."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":85,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"家族は四人です。","romaji":"Kazoku wa yo-nin desu.","meaning":"There are four people in my family."},{"japanese":"教室に学生が二人います。","romaji":"Kyoushitsu ni gakusei ga futari imasu.","meaning":"There are two students in the classroom."},{"japanese":"店にお客さんが三人います。","romaji":"Mise ni okyakusan ga san-nin imasu.","meaning":"There are three customers in the shop."},{"japanese":"会議に先生が一人来ました。","romaji":"Kaigi ni sensei ga hitori kimashita.","meaning":"One teacher came to the meeting."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":86,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"兄は二十歳です。","romaji":"Ani wa hatachi desu.","meaning":"My older brother is twenty years old."},{"japanese":"妹は八歳です。","romaji":"Imouto wa hassai desu.","meaning":"My younger sister is eight years old."},{"japanese":"田中さんの子どもは五歳です。","romaji":"Tanaka-san no kodomo wa go-sai desu.","meaning":"Tanaka's child is five years old."},{"japanese":"祖父は七十歳です。","romaji":"Sofu wa nanajussai desu.","meaning":"My grandfather is seventy years old."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":87,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"毎朝六時に家を出ます。","romaji":"Maiasa roku-ji ni ie o demasu.","meaning":"I leave home at six every morning."},{"japanese":"授業は八時に始まります。","romaji":"Jugyou wa hachi-ji ni hajimarimasu.","meaning":"Class starts at eight."},{"japanese":"夜九時に電話します。","romaji":"Yoru ku-ji ni denwa shimasu.","meaning":"I will call at nine at night."},{"japanese":"電車は五時に来ます。","romaji":"Densha wa go-ji ni kimasu.","meaning":"The train comes at five."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":88,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"駅まで五分かかります。","romaji":"Eki made go-fun kakarimasu.","meaning":"It takes five minutes to get to the station."},{"japanese":"会議は三十分です。","romaji":"Kaigi wa sanjuppun desu.","meaning":"The meeting is thirty minutes long."},{"japanese":"あと十分待ってください。","romaji":"Ato juppun matte kudasai.","meaning":"Please wait ten more minutes."},{"japanese":"学校まで二十分歩きます。","romaji":"Gakkou made nijuppun arukimasu.","meaning":"I walk for twenty minutes to school."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":89,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"週に二回テニスをします。","romaji":"Shuu ni ni-kai tenisu o shimasu.","meaning":"I play tennis twice a week."},{"japanese":"月に一回、病院へ行きます。","romaji":"Tsuki ni ikkai, byouin e ikimasu.","meaning":"I go to the hospital once a month."},{"japanese":"毎日三回、薬を飲みます。","romaji":"Mainichi san-kai, kusuri o nomimasu.","meaning":"I take medicine three times a day."},{"japanese":"一年に四回旅行します。","romaji":"Ichinen ni yon-kai ryokou shimasu.","meaning":"I travel four times a year."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":90,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"一時間ぐらい勉強します。","romaji":"Ichi-jikan gurai benkyou shimasu.","meaning":"I study for about one hour."},{"japanese":"駅まで十分ぐらいです。","romaji":"Eki made juppun gurai desu.","meaning":"It is about ten minutes to the station."},{"japanese":"りんごを五つぐらい買いました。","romaji":"Ringo o itsutsu gurai kaimashita.","meaning":"I bought about five apples."},{"japanese":"毎日二キロぐらい歩きます。","romaji":"Mainichi ni-kiro gurai arukimasu.","meaning":"I walk about two kilometres every day."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":91,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"今日は昨日より寒いです。","romaji":"Kyou wa kinou yori samui desu.","meaning":"Today is colder than yesterday."},{"japanese":"このかばんはあのかばんより軽いです。","romaji":"Kono kaban wa ano kaban yori karui desu.","meaning":"This bag is lighter than that bag."},{"japanese":"電車はバスより速いです。","romaji":"Densha wa basu yori hayai desu.","meaning":"The train is faster than the bus."},{"japanese":"大阪は京都より大きいです。","romaji":"Osaka wa Kyoto yori ookii desu.","meaning":"Osaka is bigger than Kyoto."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":92,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"私は犬のほうが猫より好きです。","romaji":"Watashi wa inu no hou ga neko yori suki desu.","meaning":"I like dogs more than cats."},{"japanese":"バスより電車のほうが便利です。","romaji":"Basu yori densha no hou ga benri desu.","meaning":"The train is more convenient than the bus."},{"japanese":"夏より春のほうが好きです。","romaji":"Natsu yori haru no hou ga suki desu.","meaning":"I like spring more than summer."},{"japanese":"この店よりあの店のほうが安いです。","romaji":"Kono mise yori ano mise no hou ga yasui desu.","meaning":"That shop is cheaper than this shop."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":93,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"一年の中で春がいちばん好きです。","romaji":"Ichinen no naka de haru ga ichiban suki desu.","meaning":"I like spring the most of all the seasons."},{"japanese":"この町で駅がいちばん大きいです。","romaji":"Kono machi de eki ga ichiban ookii desu.","meaning":"The station is the biggest place in this town."},{"japanese":"果物の中でりんごがいちばん好きです。","romaji":"Kudamono no naka de ringo ga ichiban suki desu.","meaning":"Of all fruits, I like apples the most."},{"japanese":"家族の中で父がいちばん早く起きます。","romaji":"Kazoku no naka de chichi ga ichiban hayaku okimasu.","meaning":"My father gets up the earliest in my family."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":94,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"雨が降っていますから、出かけません。","romaji":"Ame ga futte imasu kara, dekakemasen.","meaning":"Because it is raining, I will not go out."},{"japanese":"時間がありませんから、タクシーで行きます。","romaji":"Jikan ga arimasen kara, takushii de ikimasu.","meaning":"Because I do not have time, I will go by taxi."},{"japanese":"明日は試験ですから、今晩勉強します。","romaji":"Ashita wa shiken desu kara, konban benkyou shimasu.","meaning":"Because there is an exam tomorrow, I will study tonight."},{"japanese":"暑いですから、窓を開けます。","romaji":"Atsui desu kara, mado o akemasu.","meaning":"Because it is hot, I will open the window."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":95,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"この店は高いです。でも、おいしいです。","romaji":"Kono mise wa takai desu. Demo, oishii desu.","meaning":"This shop is expensive. But the food is delicious."},{"japanese":"今日は忙しいです。でも、行きます。","romaji":"Kyou wa isogashii desu. Demo, ikimasu.","meaning":"I am busy today. But I will go."},{"japanese":"雨です。でも、試合をします。","romaji":"Ame desu. Demo, shiai o shimasu.","meaning":"It is raining. But we will play the match."},{"japanese":"この本は古いです。でも、役に立ちます。","romaji":"Kono hon wa furui desu. Demo, yaku ni tachimasu.","meaning":"This book is old. But it is useful."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":96,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"朝ご飯を食べました。そして、学校へ行きました。","romaji":"Asagohan o tabemashita. Soshite, gakkou e ikimashita.","meaning":"I ate breakfast. Then I went to school."},{"japanese":"駅で切符を買いました。そして、電車に乗りました。","romaji":"Eki de kippu o kaimashita. Soshite, densha ni norimashita.","meaning":"I bought a ticket at the station. Then I got on the train."},{"japanese":"部屋を掃除しました。そして、洗濯しました。","romaji":"Heya o souji shimashita. Soshite, sentaku shimashita.","meaning":"I cleaned my room. Then I did the laundry."},{"japanese":"本を読みました。そして、感想を書きました。","romaji":"Hon o yomimashita. Soshite, kansou o kakimashita.","meaning":"I read a book. Then I wrote my thoughts."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":97,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"明日は休みです。だから、ゆっくり寝ます。","romaji":"Ashita wa yasumi desu. Dakara, yukkuri nemasu.","meaning":"Tomorrow is a day off. So I will sleep in."},{"japanese":"雨が降っています。だから、バスで行きます。","romaji":"Ame ga futte imasu. Dakara, basu de ikimasu.","meaning":"It is raining. So I will go by bus."},{"japanese":"お金がありません。だから、何も買いません。","romaji":"Okane ga arimasen. Dakara, nani mo kaimasen.","meaning":"I do not have money. So I will not buy anything."},{"japanese":"今日は寒いです。だから、コートを着ます。","romaji":"Kyou wa samui desu. Dakara, kooto o kimasu.","meaning":"It is cold today. So I will wear a coat."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":98,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"日本語を勉強するために、毎日練習します。","romaji":"Nihongo o benkyou suru tame ni, mainichi renshuu shimasu.","meaning":"I practice every day in order to study Japanese."},{"japanese":"試験に合格するために、たくさん勉強します。","romaji":"Shiken ni goukaku suru tame ni, takusan benkyou shimasu.","meaning":"I study a lot in order to pass the exam."},{"japanese":"健康のために、毎朝歩きます。","romaji":"Kenkou no tame ni, maiasa arukimasu.","meaning":"I walk every morning for my health."},{"japanese":"旅行のために、お金を貯めています。","romaji":"Ryokou no tame ni, okane o tamete imasu.","meaning":"I am saving money for a trip."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":99,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"これは日本語の教科書です。","romaji":"Kore wa nihongo no kyoukasho desu.","meaning":"This is a Japanese textbook."},{"japanese":"母の友達は医者です。","romaji":"Haha no tomodachi wa isha desu.","meaning":"My mother's friend is a doctor."},{"japanese":"駅の近くに銀行があります。","romaji":"Eki no chikaku ni ginkou ga arimasu.","meaning":"There is a bank near the station."},{"japanese":"日曜日の朝に公園へ行きます。","romaji":"Nichiyoubi no asa ni kouen e ikimasu.","meaning":"I go to the park on Sunday morning."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":100,"additional_examples":[{"japanese":"だれかがドアを開けました。","romaji":"Dareka ga doa o akemashita.","meaning":"Someone opened the door."},{"japanese":"何か飲み物を買いましょう。","romaji":"Nanika nomimono o kaimashou.","meaning":"Let's buy something to drink."},{"japanese":"どこかで昼ご飯を食べませんか。","romaji":"Dokoka de hirugohan o tabemasen ka.","meaning":"Shall we have lunch somewhere?"},{"japanese":"教室にだれかいますか。","romaji":"Kyoushitsu ni dareka imasu ka.","meaning":"Is someone in the classroom?"}]}]$n5_examples$::jsonb;
  v_updated integer;
begin
  update public.grammar_points as grammar
  set examples = coalesce(grammar.examples, '[]'::jsonb) || item.additional_examples
  from jsonb_to_recordset(v_examples) as item(
    jlpt_level text,
    sort_order integer,
    additional_examples jsonb
  )
  where grammar.jlpt_level = item.jlpt_level
    and grammar.sort_order = item.sort_order;
  get diagnostics v_updated = row_count;
  if v_updated <> 100 then
    raise exception 'Expected to expand 100 N5 grammar sets, updated %', v_updated;
  end if;
end;
$expand_n5_grammar_examples$;
commit;
